    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάκη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wickedness, vice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1335
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				541
			</span></i>, etc.; of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				247b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>baseness of spirit, cowardice, sloth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄψυχον κάκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					192
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήματος κάκῃ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				616
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειλίαν καὶ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				676
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Med.</u>
				1051
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοντας κάκῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Mx.</u>
					246b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ κάκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					468a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
